WEBVTT

00:06:56.911 --> 00:07:02.156
But I can tell you that they do
express themselves.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:05.234
Whether or not we understand
it is a different story.

00:07:05.258 --> 00:07:07.562
I was walking along the shore in Alaska,

00:07:07.586 --> 00:07:09.906
and I came across this tide pool

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.938
filled with a colony of sea anemones,

00:07:12.962 --> 00:07:15.014
these wonderful eating machines,

00:07:15.038 --> 00:07:17.865
relatives of coral and jellyfish.

00:07:17.889 --> 00:07:20.223
And curious to see
if any of them made any noise,

00:07:20.247 --> 00:07:21.394
I dropped a hydrophone,

00:07:21.418 --> 00:07:24.386
an underwater microphone
covered in rubber,

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:25.574
down the mouth part,

00:07:25.598 --> 00:07:27.335
and immediately the critter began

00:07:27.359 --> 00:07:29.544
to absorb the microphone into its belly,

00:07:29.568 --> 00:07:32.238
and the tentacles were
searching out of the surface